#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:26
msgid "同步发送路径"
msgstr "Synchronous transmit path"

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:28
msgid ""
"接收按相反方向经过这些边界：每 PHY 的 parser 调用 wire 验证完整帧并生成借用视图，datalink 和 network 传递该视图；network 完成本地认证后，transport 才修改"
" peer 状态。完整帧 CRC 只计算一次。直接提交原始帧的内部入口仍先验证输入，不能冒充已验证视图。"
msgstr ""
"Receive reverses the boundary direction: each PHY parser calls wire to validate a complete frame and "
"produce a borrowed view. Datalink and network pass that view through; network verifies local "
"authentication before transport changes peer state. The complete-frame CRC is computed once. Internal "
"raw-frame entry points still validate their inputs before delivery."

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:30
msgid ""
"普通、认证和原地发送共用帧长度规划与编码规则，统一由 datalink 提交 PHY。转发不创建本地 transport 状态，但也经过该 PHY 出口。可靠重传从持有的逻辑包重新组合帧，保留 DATA "
"编号并取得新的安全序号。"
msgstr ""
"Copied, authenticated and in-place sends share frame measurement and encoding rules, with datalink as "
"the single PHY submission owner. Forwarding creates no local transport state but uses that same PHY "
"exit. Reliable retransmission starts from an owned logical packet and traverses frame composition again,"
" retaining its DATA number while obtaining a fresh security sequence."

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:32
msgid "所有权与执行"
msgstr "Ownership and Execution"

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:34
msgid ""
"一个 peer 唯一持有 `(remote_id, connection_id, session_epoch)` 对应的窗口、等待 ACK 记录、RTT "
"和接收顺序。借用的包/帧视图不得超出同步调用；需要保留的载荷由明确资源类别持有。安全状态独立于 peer 生命周期，不随 transport RESET 清除。"
msgstr ""
"One peer owns one exact `(remote_id, connection_id, session_epoch)` scope, including its window, wait-"
"ACK records, RTT and receive order. Borrowed packet/frame views never outlive a synchronous call; "
"retained payloads have a resource-class owner. Security state is separate from peer lifetime and "
"survives transport RESET."

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:36
msgid ""
"实例持有唯一 security context，各层借用它；每个唯一 PHY 描述符对应一个 parser 和 RX cache，共用 PHY 的多条路由不会重复预留。已缓存的乱序包在应用 BUSY "
"时继续占用接收槽，直到交付或所属 scope 关闭或失败。"
msgstr ""
"The instance owns one security context, borrowed by the layers. Each unique PHY descriptor owns one "
"parser and RX cache; multiple routes sharing that descriptor do not reserve duplicates. A retained out-"
"of-order frame keeps its storage while the application reports BUSY."

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:38
msgid ""
"同一实例由调用方串行访问。回调不得重入或销毁该实例。时钟和实例调度由应用提供。工作区固定，运行阶段只消耗已预留资源。参见[内存](resource-"
"model.md)与[平台](../guides/porting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Calls on one instance are serialized by the caller. Callbacks cannot reenter or destroy that instance. "
"The application provides the clock and schedules protocol work. Runtime operations use the fixed "
"workspace reservations. See [Memory](resource-model.md) and [Platform](../guides/porting.md)."

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:40
msgid "源码与构建边界"
msgstr "Source and Build Boundaries"

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:42
msgid ""
"`include/xgl/` 仅保留公开 SDK。私有头与实现同放 "
"`src/api`、`wire`、`datalink`、`network`、`transport`、`security`；跨层数据与资源契约放 `src/internal`。私有目录不安装、不导出给消费者。"
msgstr ""
"`include/xgl/` contains only the public SDK. Private headers live with their implementations under "
"`src/api`, `wire`, `datalink`, `network`, `transport` and `security`. Cross-layer data and resource "
"contracts live under `src/internal`. Private directories are neither installed nor exported to "
"consumers."

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:44
msgid ""
"生产导出一个 `xgl::xgl` target。`cmake/XglVersion.cmake` 为库与独立文档提供版本，`XglProfiles.cmake` "
"解析档位与资源身份，`XglSources.cmake` 按能力列出生产编译单元，`XglLibrary.cmake` 组装带匹配配置头的库。`XglInstall.cmake` 导出 "
"SDK，`XglDevelopment.cmake` 接入按需启用的开发检查。"
msgstr ""
"Production exports one `xgl::xgl` target. `cmake/XglVersion.cmake` supplies the version to the library "
"and standalone docs. `XglProfiles.cmake` resolves the profile and resource identity, `XglSources.cmake` "
"selects the production translation units by capability, and `XglLibrary.cmake` assembles the library "
"with its matching configuration header. `XglInstall.cmake` exports the SDK and `XglDevelopment.cmake` "
"registers the selected development checks."

#: docs/zh/explanation/architecture.md:46
msgid ""
"协议回归位于 `test/unit/<layer>`、`test/integration` 和 `test/property`。`test/smoke` 保存 C11 夹具，`test/interop` 保存"
" Wire v1 双端点夹具，`test/contracts` 按构建、安装与 CTest 区分验证对象。历史用例和回放种子由现有发现入口维护。"
msgstr ""
"Protocol regression suites live under `test/unit/<layer>`, `test/integration`, and `test/property`. "
"`test/smoke` contains the C11 fixtures, `test/interop` contains Wire v1 peer fixtures, and "
"`test/contracts` groups build, SDK and CTest checks. Test discovery preserves historical names and "
"replay seeds."
